        <mxCell id="flow-notes" value="Flows&#xa;Mac -SSH 22-&gt; IGW -&gt; Parent&#xa;Parent -SSH 22 / HTTP 8080-&gt; Worker fleet (private IPs inside VPC)&#xa;Workers -docker pull (on boot via user_data)-&gt; ECR (auth via IAM)&#xa;ASG manages desired=126 -&gt; Worker fleet&#xa;&#xa;Capacity&#xa;parent 2 vCPU + workers 252 vCPU = 254 / 256 (On-Demand Standard quota)&#xa;total RAM 4 GiB + 252 GiB = 256 GiB&#xa;&#xa;Deliberate absences&#xa;no NAT gateway (workers are in public subnets with IGW egress)&#xa;no ALB / NLB (parent fan-out with asyncio)&#xa;no RDS / ElastiCache / S3 mount (stateless hello world)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
